!include ../_style.puml

title 影片批次狀態機圖

[*] --> creating : createVideoBatch / persist batch shell
creating --> processing : firstItemPersisted / store ordered items
processing --> processing : poll [nonterminal items remain] / recompute counts
processing --> completed : aggregate [all items completed] / save completed
processing --> partial : aggregate [completed > 0 and failed > 0] / save partial
processing --> failed : aggregate [all items failed] / save failed
partial --> processing : retryItem [retryable failed item] / queue video
failed --> processing : retryItem [retryable item] / queue video
completed --> [*] : archiveView / keep durable history
partial --> [*] : noFurtherRetry / keep per-item results
failed --> [*] : noFurtherRetry / keep error details

note right of processing
  對應設計類別：VideoBatch。
  batch 狀態由逐項 Video processing 彙整，部分成功不回滾成功項。
end note

@enduml
